                                        "entry_id": "5c27ff70-ad27-3ec5-a04d-e1509eb73a90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A city, the capital of the state of Salzburg, western Austria, famed for its baroque architecture and importance in musical history."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26cc9d4f-d374-4cb0-a811-da67122cb9bf",
                                                "sense_id": "499fc11b-5b93-31b4-bfc8-c75ae135a31b",
                                                "text": "Take Salzburg. By no means the chief city of Austria, but a Jerusalem to any music lover."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7b97545-a77a-4f05-9f9b-371d6021dd9b",
                                                "sense_id": "499fc11b-5b93-31b4-bfc8-c75ae135a31b",
                                                "text": "At the age of 22, the Norwegian forward had already established himself as one of the best goalscorers in European football – first at Red Bull Salzburg, then with two prolific seasons at Borussia Dortmund."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19424a69-50e9-376c-9a76-04249401bfac",
                                        "entry_id": "5c27ff70-ad27-3ec5-a04d-e1509eb73a90",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The present federal state of Austria surrounding the city."
